<urn:atm:triage:finding/RBQA-BA5-F004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RBQA-BA5-F004" ;
  triage:title "PendingNudgeStore has four independently hand-rolled test-double reimplementations of its full 6-method surface" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-1 (ruthless-boundary-qa, minor), PR #1407 @ b617a9eab, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1407#issuecomment-5642789392. PendingNudgeStore has one production impl but four independently hand-rolled test-double reimplementations of its full 6-method surface (DummyPendingNudgeStore, FailingClearPendingStore, FailingMarkPendingStore, RecordingPendingNudgeStore) across 4 crates, reintroducing the exact duplication pattern already fixed once for the sibling GraftReceiverEndpointStore trait (RBQA-F002/F003 precedent, contract.rs:1390-1394). fenix's ruling (https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1407#issuecomment-5642806916): minor RBQA-BA5-F004 (four hand-rolled PendingNudgeStore doubles) -> BA.6 fold-in." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "duplication" ;
  triage:severity "minor" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "PendingNudgeStore test doubles (4 crates: DummyPendingNudgeStore, FailingClearPendingStore, FailingMarkPendingStore, RecordingPendingNudgeStore)" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T02:14:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix's BA.5 QA-1 ruling (https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1407#issuecomment-5642806916) folds this into BA.6, not BA.5. Further promoted by fenix's cleanup ruling (ATM 2026-09-12T04:44:29Z): worktree layer 5, fix/phase-ba-cleanup (new gh-stack layer above docs/ba6, cipher single writer) -- arch-ctm's BA6-CLEANUP task is cancelled; fix lands once on the cleanup layer, not on docs/ba6." ;
  triage:promoteTo "fix/phase-ba-cleanup" ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BA6 ;
